-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)] </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">국립대학육성사업 프로그램 취재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">영상 콘텐츠 기획 및 제작</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">활동혜택</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">홍보활동을 위한 디자인 및 영상 제작 관련 교육 제공</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">매월 활동비 지급</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">3) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">홍보활동을 위한 단체복 지급</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">4) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">매월 우수 활동자를 선정하여 인센티브 지급</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">5) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">활동기간 후 홍보대사 활동 수료증 수여</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:106.7pt;text-indent:-106.7pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">접수방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">지원서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">첨부파일 참고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">작성 후 이메일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(joonsoo@cnu.ac.kr) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">접수</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">8. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">선발일정</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">모집기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 2026. 7. 22.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">) ~ 8. 9.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">) 24:00 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">합격자 발표</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 2026. 8. 18.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">) 18:00 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">예정</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"E